{"id": "d34b15f9-4d02-4ce3-872d-56f0e6c500e4", "name": "D推定式", "description": "時刻 n+1 におけるハイドロゲーションもしくは塩濃度等に関わる劣化指標Dの値（図29 ΣD制御式の一部）を、前時刻の値、時間変化量、電流、および各種定数を用いて計算する。", "inputNames": ["alpha", "dt", "dn", "beta", "c0", "current"], "outputNames": ["dn_next"], "parameters": {}, "code": "dn_next = (1 - alpha * dt) * dn + (beta / c0) * current * dt", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T12:47:16.823733", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
