{"id": "ddc62277-8444-4365-8337-a0cbfb76bc15", "name": "急速充電電流制限値算出制約", "description": "累積劣化度(ΣD)が許容値に近づくにつれて、急速充電電流制限値を減衰させて算出します。基準最大電流を120Aと仮定します。", "inputNames": ["sum_d", "sum_d_allowable"], "outputNames": ["charge_current_limit"], "parameters": {}, "code": "limit_ratio = max(0.0, 1.0 - (sum_d / sum_d_allowable))\ncharge_current_limit = 120.0 * limit_ratio", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T12:51:03.738466", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
